# BEGIN LIGHTNODE VLESS KILL SWITCH
pass out quick on lo0 all no state
pass out quick on {{TUN_IF}} inet all no state
pass in quick on {{PHYSICAL_IF}} inet from {{MANAGEMENT_CIDR}} to any keep state
pass out quick on {{PHYSICAL_IF}} inet from any to {{MANAGEMENT_CIDR}} keep state
pass out quick on {{PHYSICAL_IF}} inet proto tcp to {{VPS_IP}} port {{VPS_PORT}} keep state
pass out quick on {{PHYSICAL_IF}} inet proto udp from port 68 to port 67 keep state
anchor "com.lightnode.vless-killswitch"
load anchor "com.lightnode.vless-killswitch" from "/etc/pf.anchors/com.lightnode.vless-killswitch"
# END LIGHTNODE VLESS KILL SWITCH
